-[Ho-sik] No, no.

19
00:01:31,739 --> 00:01:33,991
-Hmm, perfect.
-Now you covered it too much.

20
00:01:34,116 --> 00:01:36,118
-[sighs] Where should we put this?
-And Hot Choco Chips won't fit.

21
