It used to be our company's
biggest hit product.

22
00:01:40,039 --> 00:01:42,458
Uh, how about putting it
right in the center? [sighs]

23
00:01:42,583 --> 00:01:45,502
Hatguma just launched.
They look nice next to each other.

24
00:01:45,628 --> 00:01:47,963
Let's drag it over there
and see how it looks.

25
00:01:48,088 --> 00:01:50,215
-[Ho-sik] What are you-- Uh, no.
-[Sang-hun] Just grab the bottom.

26
00:01:50,341 --> 00:01:51,717
[Ho-sik] Don't move it.
I like it where it is.

27
00:01:51,842 --> 00:01:52,676
BROTHER CLEANING

28
00:01:52,801 --> 00:01:53,886
[music fades]

29
