Lee Mi-do and I broke up, you know that.

80
00:04:59,238 --> 00:05:01,448
Check the playground. Focus on the slide.

81
00:05:01,573 --> 00:05:03,867
[Yeong-do]  Come on, you two
are gonna get back together anyway.

82
00:05:03,992 --> 00:05:06,578
