[Tae-seung sighs]

144
00:08:40,792 --> 00:08:42,919
I waited for you to answer,
but you didn't.

145
00:08:43,587 --> 00:08:46,089
I figured out your usual haunts,
so I did some research beforehand,

146
00:08:46,214 --> 00:08:47,215
