147
00:08:48,842 --> 00:08:53,638
Ahyeon Library, Hanpung Bookstore,
Haneul Park, Jake Coffee in Gongdeok,

148
00:08:53,764 --> 00:08:55,557
Nemo's Cafe, and… [inhales sharply]

149
00:08:55,682 --> 00:08:59,061
…grilled fish at Yeoju Auntie's. Wow.

150
00:08:59,186 --> 00:09:01,396
The charcoal-grilled mackerel is fire.

151
00:09:04,232 --> 00:09:07,944
[inhales sharply]
You really should sign the settlement.

152
00:09:09,780 --> 00:09:13,658
We'll guarantee
that you get 30 percent copyright.

153
